        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=1,-1$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y'&=4x^3-12x\\\\y''&=12x^2-12\\\\12x^2-12&=0\\\\x^2&=1\\\\x&=\\pm1\\end{align*}$$",
